[ VERY STUPID VECTOR LIBRARY ]

The world's dumbest vector library, made
solely because some people are stupid.

[        COMPILATION         ]
Please don't compile this.

	make

Or, if you like bending over to Microsoft,

	nmake /f Nmakefile


[       DOCUMENTATION        ]
In my infinite wisdom, I have added
Doxygen-formatted comments into the header.

How thoughtful of me!

Available at http://verystupidvectors.github.io


[         CHANGELOG          ]
libvsv v0.1.0
	- VSV is added
	- intended to be used with vsv.h
	- simple example suite
	- Doxygen documentation
libvsv v0.1.1
	- VSV_VEC now replaces VSV
	- VSV/VSV_VEC is now a truly opaque struct stub
	  intended to be a pointer allocated internally
	  by the library
	- As VSV_VEC is a opaque struct pointer type,
	  all functions no longer require referencing (& operator).
	- vsvint.h is added for internal use only

[          ROADMAP           ]
You haven't seen shit yet.
Planned for libvsv v0.1.2 are std::deques and std::lists,
along with a more complete testing suite.
